  "notes": [
    "Use connected-* at uniform scale for an exact selected-tab/board seam.",
    "Individual surfaces include transparent shadow gutters. Face rects and nine-patch margins are in each PNG variant.",
    "Tile the nine-patch center to preserve grain proportions; do not stretch a whole PNG.",
    "1x variants map to logical units. 2x variants have every coordinate doubled; scale the entire UI consistently.",
    "Labels, quantities, interactive hit targets and focus rings remain native Godot controls."
  ]
